From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bjarne <87858321+bjakra@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 22:40:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] SystemUI: Now Playing song on the lock screen
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

A lock screen indication shows the song Graphite Now Playing recognised
("♪ Track • Artist") for as long as Now Playing shows it (until the
track's estimated end, as Ambient Music Mod's lock screen line did), read
from org.graphite.nowplaying.api and refreshed when it announces a
change. Off with Now Playing's "Show the song" switch.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
